# ==============================================================
# 12. SKENARIO LENGKAP (urutan testing end-to-end)
# ==============================================================
#
# 1. POST /auth/login (andi@gmail.com)           → copy token → tempel ke @token
# 2. GET  /workers                               → copy salah satu id → tempel ke @workerId
# 3. GET  /workers/{{workerId}}                  → lihat detail pekerja
# 4. POST /favorites/{{workerId}}                → simpan ke favorit
# 5. POST /orders                                → buat pesanan → copy id → @orderId
# 6. GET  /orders/{{orderId}}                    → cek status pesanan
#
# -- Ganti ke akun pekerja --
# 7. POST /auth/login (budi.listrik@gmail.com)   → copy token → tempel ke @token
# 8. GET  /orders?status=menunggu                → lihat pesanan masuk
# 9. PUT  /orders/{{orderId}}/confirm            → konfirmasi pesanan
# 10. PUT /orders/{{orderId}}/complete           → tandai selesai
#
# -- Ganti kembali ke pelanggan --
# 11. POST /auth/login (andi@gmail.com)          → copy token → tempel ke @token
# 12. POST /reviews                              → tulis ulasan
# 13. GET  /workers/{{workerId}}/reviews         → lihat ulasan terbaru muncul
# 14. GET  /notifications                        → cek notifikasi
# 15. PUT  /notifications/read-all              → tandai semua dibaca
#
